  want to allow travel well sometimes they  might have a valid  reason if you've threatened to say hey  i'm taking the kids back to my parents  country or my home country and i'm not  bringing them back you're never going to  see it again  well these are valid concerns and  threats so  if you deny your ex the ability to leave  the country to take your kids out of the  country  the only way they can do so is with the  court order so they'll have to  ask the judge to to hear the case and  say hey i want to take my kids to visit  family  in germany or in mexico or another  country  and my ex will not allow it so then the  judge has to decide if it's reasonable  to allow this or not  a lot of times if you are found to  unreasonably deny this request then you  might have to pay  your ex's attorney's fees for having to  file the motion to argue this  uh and bring this in front of the judge  so if you're going to deny it make sure  that you have valid points valid reasons  for doing so  if not it's best just to communicate  well with your ex  and try to be reasonable and always  think of what's  the well-being of the kids yeah  hopefully everyone has an enjoyable and  peaceful summer that way  eric always good to talk to you thanks  for joining us thank you for having me  you can get more information by giving  er palacios and associates a call that  phone number seven zero two  four four four seven seven seven seven  also you can visit their website at  ericpalacioslaw.com  jc
 

